  "notes": "FORMATION:\n{聞|き}く (to hear) + {慣|な}れる (to become accustomed) → to become accustomed to hearing\n\nCOMMON USAGE:\nOften used in the negative form {聞|き}き{慣|な}れない to describe unfamiliar sounds or expressions.\n\nRELATED COMPOUND VERBS:\n- {食|た}べ{慣|な}れる (to become used to eating)\n- {見|み}{慣|な}れる (to become used to seeing)\n- {住|す}み{慣|な}れる (to become used to living)\n- {使|つか}い{慣|な}れる (to become used to using)",
